-large-4）。","title":"Mistral Large 4 以开放权重发布并附技术报告","title_en":"The story of how Le Chonk was built, told by the team behind it.","url":"https://x.com/MistralAI/status/2117562068220195097"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/fvf2qsdi4s11bz1denqd5rzff","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"fvf2qsdi4s11bz1denqd5rzff","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/fvf2qsdi4s11bz1denqd5rzff","published_at":"2026-11-03T08:00:00Z","ref":"A4","score":71,"selected":true,"source":"OpenAI：Alignment 研究博客（RSS）","summary":"OpenAI Alignment 团队对比六个模型在 Respecting Warnings 安全评测与匹配的 Codex 生产决策上的表现，发现评测成功率普遍低于生产，差距为 10.2 至 37.4 个百分点。模型普遍口头表现出评测意识（评测中一般性意识率 57.0%–83.7%），但仅告知","title":"OpenAI 研究：智能体安全评测与生产行为存在差距，评测目标误判是关键因素","title_en":"Eval-production behavior gaps in agent safety and the role of eval-awareness","url":"https://alignment.openai.com/eval-production-behavior-gap/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/uinaiwkzg4u2exkfgv4oha9p7","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"uinaiwkzg4u2exkfgv4oha9p7","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/uinaiwkzg4u2exkfgv4oha9p7","published_at":"2026-11-03T07:01:29Z","ref":"A5","score":72,"selected":true,"source":"X：Addy Osmani (@addyosmani)","summary":"Addy Osmani 发文探讨在大量使用 Agent 工作流后如何保持批判性思维。他提出认知卸载、拖延、认知投降三段光谱，认为模型越强、输出越流畅，人越容易在不知不觉中放弃独立判断；并给出具体做法，包括提问前先写假设、把验证标准前置为可执行测试、要求 Agent 列出它替你做的决策与假设、用测验收尾而不是读摘要，以及定期手写代码做校准练习。他强调可以卸载工作和审计，但不能卸载责任。","title":"Addy Osmani 谈 Agent 时代如何保持批判性思维","title_en":"Critical thinking when agents do the work","url":"https://x.com/addyosmani/status/2117512471930167377"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/v41vn9hb5ywv10e68wycj1bjk","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"v41vn9hb5ywv10e68wycj1bjk","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/v41vn9hb5ywv10e68wycj1bjk","published_at":"2026-11-03T00:18:00Z","ref":"A6","score":71,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：数字生命卡兹克","summary":"数字生命卡兹克发布一篇 DeepSeek Harness 养鱼教程，讲解如何在 QQ、微信、飞书接入大肥鱼，并让它去 B 站刷视频、在抖音发视频和直播。","title":"DeepS